id: pm-st7wgu
title: "GH-951: required-field policy can force fabricated relationship edges"
description: Separate relational deliberation from value presence so strict creation policy can require an explicit no-dependency assertion without inventing graph data.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[6]: "area:cli","area:graph","area:sdk",context-management,gh-951,governance
