completed_at: "2026-08-09T22:09:09.083Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 420
acceptance_criteria: The public SDK models required relational inputs as considered states distinct from present values; CLI accepts an explicit no-dependency assertion without writing a dependency edge; the assertion is auditable in the mutation receipt/history; empty-workspace and nonempty-workspace behavior is deterministic; create help contracts MCP schemas completions and docs expose the same semantics; regression tests prove no fabricated edge and strict-policy satisfaction
goal: project management = context management
objective: Make strict context policy truthful and satisfiable
value: Agents can prove they considered graph context without polluting the relationship graph
why_now: The current gate directly incentivizes fabricated dependencies
parent: pm-mpbb
risk: medium
confidence: high
severity: high
resolution: Added explicit empty repeatable-field intent without persisting fabricated dependencies.
expected_result: Strict create policy accepts a deliberate no-dependency assertion and writes no edge.
actual_result: "Integration acceptance proves policy satisfaction, auditable intent, and an empty dependency set."
