close_reason: Truthful considered-empty relationship policy is implemented and verified.
body: GitHub #951 shows that a workspace may require --dep even for the first or genuinely independent item. Every-status duplicate search found relationship validation and create-policy work but no item covering an explicit considered-none assertion or satisfiability of relational required fields. This must preserve graph truth instead of weakening strict policy.
